data.content:
In .NET 10, `Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi` upgraded its dependency from **Microsoft.OpenApi v1.x to v2.x**. Here are the breaking changes and fixes:

---

## 1. `OpenApiString` / `OpenApiAny` types removed

The `Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` namespace is gone. Examples are now `JsonNode`:

```csharp
// Before
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Any;
param.Schema.Example = new OpenApiString("1.0");

// After
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
```

---

## 2. `schema.Nullable` removed

Nullable is now expressed via the `Type` flags enum including `JsonSchemaType.Null`:

```csharp
// Before
property.Value.Nullable = false;

// After — remove Null from the type flags
property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;

// To make something nullable:
property.Value.Type |= JsonSchemaType.Null;
```

(`JsonSchemaType` is in `Microsoft.OpenApi.Models`.)

---

## 3. `OpenApiReference` / `Reference` property removed from models

In v2, reference wrappers are separate types. Use `OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference`:

```csharp
// Before
var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecurityScheme
{
    Reference = new OpenApiReference { Type = ReferenceType.SecurityScheme, Id = "oauth2" }
};
operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
{
    new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
};

// After
var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");
operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
{
    new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
};
```

---

## 4. `OpenApiResponses` → plain dictionary

`operation.Responses` is now `IDictionary<string, OpenApiResponse>` — `TryAdd` still works, no change needed there. But if you were using `OpenApiResponses`-specific methods elsewhere, switch to standard dictionary APIs.

---

## Complete fixed code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
                property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

**Summary of namespace changes:**
| Removed | Replacement |
|---------|------------|
| `Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` | `System.Text.Json.Nodes` |
| `OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. | `JsonValue.Create(...)` |
| `OpenApiSecurityScheme` + `Reference` | `OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("id")` |
| `schema.Nullable` | `schema.Type` with `JsonSchemaType.Null` flag |
